{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1489741818,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyMTQ5NDU5Njc=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1379","origin":"github"},"title":"`AnnexRepo.get()` should not intercept the generator it gets from the `annex get` call","message":"There actual use of this low-level function should be investigated. High-level access should go through `api.get` which can return a list (among many other things). At present, however, `AnnexRepo.get` does not enable `api.get` to actually benefit from this internally provided generator.\n\nI propose to return the generator as is, unconditionally.\n\nObjections?","files":null}]}